    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "Reincarnation offers a rich, deep, and immersive medieval and fantasy-themed deck-builder game experience for players who enjoy the strategy and excitement of turn-based RPG card games.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386090/extras/3c281b2c791704512c968389191dcb56.avif?t=1687261115\" /></span><br><br>Players have the ability to build their own unique decks with hundreds of cards, each with a wide variety of abilities and strengths. As they progress through the game; they can choose from range of classes, level up their characters, equip them with powerful weapons and armors that best suits their play style.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386090/extras/98d541c280047c0707907173606cdb92.poster.avif?t=1687261115\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386090/extras/98d541c280047c0707907173606cdb92.webm?t=1687261115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386090/extras/98d541c280047c0707907173606cdb92.mp4?t=1687261115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Players will travel across the map that is filled with danger and adventure. Each time they embark on a journey, they will face different enemies, choose different cards, discover different items (relics, potions, gears), and even fight different bosses. This ever-changing gameplay and enriched story with side quests will ensure that every playthrough is unique and exciting, and keeps players engaged for hours on end.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386090/extras/3631f5933e8e2777dabb408c4adda1e7.poster.avif?t=1687261115\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386090/extras/3631f5933e8e2777dabb408c4adda1e7.webm?t=1687261115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386090/extras/3631f5933e8e2777dabb408c4adda1e7.mp4?t=1687261115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A constantly evolving deck-building experience</li><li>Acquire powerful relics and potions that can turn the tide of battle</li><li>Progress through different scenarios of three different acts</li><li>Choose from four unique characters, each with their own set of cards</li><li>Hundreds of cards to play with a wide variety of options</li><li>Hundreds of different items for players to find and utilize throughout the journey</li><li>Dozens of combat encounters with unique enemies and bosses</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Reincarnation offers a rich, deep, and immersive medieval and fantasy-themed deck-builder game experience for players who enjoy the strategy and excitement of turn-based RPG card games.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386090/extras/3c281b2c791704512c968389191dcb56.avif?t=1687261115\" /></span><br><br>Players have the ability to build their own unique decks with hundreds of cards, each with a wide variety of abilities and strengths. As they progress through the game; they can choose from range of classes, level up their characters, equip them with powerful weapons and armors that best suits their play style.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386090/extras/98d541c280047c0707907173606cdb92.poster.avif?t=1687261115\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386090/extras/98d541c280047c0707907173606cdb92.webm?t=1687261115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386090/extras/98d541c280047c0707907173606cdb92.mp4?t=1687261115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Players will travel across the map that is filled with danger and adventure. Each time they embark on a journey, they will face different enemies, choose different cards, discover different items (relics, potions, gears), and even fight different bosses. This ever-changing gameplay and enriched story with side quests will ensure that every playthrough is unique and exciting, and keeps players engaged for hours on end.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386090/extras/3631f5933e8e2777dabb408c4adda1e7.poster.avif?t=1687261115\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386090/extras/3631f5933e8e2777dabb408c4adda1e7.webm?t=1687261115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386090/extras/3631f5933e8e2777dabb408c4adda1e7.mp4?t=1687261115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A constantly evolving deck-building experience</li><li>Acquire powerful relics and potions that can turn the tide of battle</li><li>Progress through different scenarios of three different acts</li><li>Choose from four unique characters, each with their own set of cards</li><li>Hundreds of cards to play with a wide variety of options</li><li>Hundreds of different items for players to find and utilize throughout the journey</li><li>Dozens of combat encounters with unique enemies and bosses</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Reincarnation is a medieval/fantasy themed turn-based RPG card game with unique deck-building, character development and class selection experiences. Devise your attack and defense strategies to defeat monsters and gain rewards. Join the action-packed world of Reincarnation today!",
